# Line endings are normalised to LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Without this, Git for Windows checks files out with CRLF by default, which
# changes every file's byte count — and therefore every `node.bytes` in the
# atlas. The cross-platform atlas fingerprint check in CI would then fail on
# Windows for a reason that has nothing to do with the indexer.
* text=auto eol=lf
